<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Soulfire</h1>
<p>Sphere: Fire Sphere
Class: Dark Knight (guild level 100)
Mana: 40
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast soulfire &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast soulfire</a>   (at whoever you are fighting)
</pre>
<p>The last and fiercest of the dark knight's fires: a fire that burns the very 
soul of the target. The better your power and fire sphere, the more it burns. 
It does better against clothes than against plate. A shield takes some of 
it, but can't stop it.
</p><p>Casting it is an attack and starts a fight. It is also found on staffs, 
wands and scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Lava Flow</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Hellfire</a>
